{%- comment -%}
  Paste this into the "Quadrant" tab of the weather-yr plugin's Edit Markup
  screen (separate from the "Full" tab's template.liquid). Compact version
  for small Mashup panes.

  Font-family is set inline to force smooth Inter instead of the default
  pixel font, scoped to just this plugin (see template.liquid for why).

  Layout (top to bottom):
    1. One row: random Banksy icon + weather icon + current temperature +
       clothing/rain/wind icon(s).
    2. Four day-part blocks in a 2x2 grid (06-12 | 12-18 on top, 18-00 |
       00-06 below). Each block = random Banksy icon + weather icon + time
       label over temperature. From day_parts in data.json (see
       buildDayParts() / banksyIconUrls() in fetch.mjs).
    3. Rain forecast text.
  (No condition description and no H/L line - both removed on request.)

  Banksy icons come from generate-banksy-icons.mjs. Until that has been
  run, their URLs are null and those cells are simply left out.

  ROW WIDTH RULE (learned the hard way, twice): a Quadrant pane is only
  ~1/4 of the screen. TRMNL centers a row's content, so a row wider than
  the pane is clipped equally on both edges - which silently deleted the
  icons at the ends AND chopped up the temperature digits in the middle
  (commit 35fb824 and later). Icons + temperature on one row are OK, but
  ONLY as separate <td> cells with small icons. Worst case top row: 5
  icons x 40px + temperature cell = roughly 290px of a ~400px pane; each
  2x2 row is roughly 2 x (32+32+50) + gap = ~260px. If you add anything
  to a row, re-check the total width.

  All icon <img> tags use class="image image--contain image-dither" and
  each sits alone in its own <td> - never as flex siblings of another
  <img>. Both were needed for icons to render at all on the device (see
  template.liquid and README for the full story).

  The temperature keeps a real TRMNL value--* class rather than a custom
  inline font-size - arbitrary font sizes corrupted the digits in earlier
  testing.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="layout layout--col layout--center gap--small" style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
  <table class="table" style="border: none; width: auto; margin: 0 auto;">
    <tr>
      {% if current.banksy_icon_url %}
      <td style="border: none; padding: 0 2px; vertical-align: middle;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ current.banksy_icon_url }}" width="36" height="36" style="width: 36px; height: 36px;"></td>
      {% endif %}
      <td style="border: none; padding: 0 2px; vertical-align: middle;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ current.icon_url }}" width="36" height="36" style="width: 36px; height: 36px;"></td>
      <td style="border: none; padding: 0 6px; vertical-align: middle;"><span class="value value--small">{{ current.temperature }}°</span></td>
      <td style="border: none; padding: 0 2px; vertical-align: middle;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ current.clothing_icon_url }}" width="36" height="36" style="width: 36px; height: 36px;"></td>
      {% if current.needs_rain_gear %}
      <td style="border: none; padding: 0 2px; vertical-align: middle;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ current.rain_gear_icon_url }}" width="36" height="36" style="width: 36px; height: 36px;"></td>
      {% endif %}
      {% if current.needs_wind_gear %}
      <td style="border: none; padding: 0 2px; vertical-align: middle;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ current.wind_gear_icon_url }}" width="36" height="36" style="width: 36px; height: 36px;"></td>
      {% endif %}
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table class="table" style="border: none; width: auto; margin: 0 auto;">
    {% for row_start in (0..1) %}
    <tr>
      {% for col in (0..1) %}
      {% assign idx = row_start | times: 2 | plus: col %}
      {% assign part = day_parts[idx] %}
      {% if part.banksy_icon_url %}
      <td style="border: none; padding: 2px 2px 2px {% if col == 1 %}14px{% else %}2px{% endif %}; vertical-align: middle;"><img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ part.banksy_icon_url }}" width="32" height="32" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"></td>
      {% endif %}
      <td style="border: none; padding: 2px; vertical-align: middle;">{% if part.icon_url %}<img class="image image--contain image-dither" src="{{ part.icon_url }}" width="32" height="32" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;">{% endif %}</td>
      <td style="border: none; padding: 2px 4px; vertical-align: middle; text-align: left;">
        <div class="description">{{ part.label }}</div>
        <div class="label">{% if part.temperature != nil %}{{ part.temperature }}°{% else %}–{% endif %}</div>
      </td>
      {% endfor %}
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table>

  <div class="description">{{ current.rain_forecast_text }}</div>
</div>

<div class="title_bar" style="font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
  <span class="title">Alsjön</span>
  <span class="instance">{{ updated_display }}</span>
</div>
